% ATTRIBUTION RESOLVED 2026-08-23 against project/pruning_factory.py:438.
% The SNIPPruner docstring is explicit: the SCORE is SNIP's connection
% sensitivity |w * dL/dw| (Lee, Ajanthan & Torr, ICLR 2019, arXiv:1810.02340,
% their Eq. 6 with the normalisation constant dropped), while the ITERATIVE
% re-application every delta_T steps at a growing sparsity is SNIP-it
% (Verdenius, Stol & Forre, arXiv:2006.00896).  Cite BOTH -- lee2019snip for
% the criterion, verdenius2020snipit for the iterative schedule.  de Jorge et
% al. (arXiv:2006.09081) is the adjacent 'Progressive Skeletonization'/FORCE
% line, is NOT this method, and its entry has been removed.
@article{verdenius2020snipit,
